---
name: reconcile-payouts
description: Reconcile ledger and bank payout exports and report grouped differences. Use when checking whether recorded payouts match bank settlement records.
---

# Reconcile Payouts

Compare ledger and bank exports by payout ID using the supplied amount_minor values. Report the ledger total, bank total, and difference for each payout ID.

Use signed integer amounts. Keep currencies separate and label missing currencies as unknown. Include unmatched groups in the exception report; do not discard them. Preserve original input files.
